Clinics and receptionists need to track previous bookings and operational activity.

## Receptionist history

Provide a historical view for authorized receptionists covering the clinic or clinics they are assigned to.

Include:

- Past appointment requests.
- Approved bookings.
- Rejected requests.
- Cancelled appointments.
- Completed visits.
- No-shows.
- Token history.
- Check-in and queue status history.

Use the application's actual workflow and available data.

Do not label an appointment as a completed consultation solely because its token was called.

## Clinic administrator history

Allow authorized clinic administrators to retrieve historical operational records for their clinic.

Support:

- Historical appointment counts.
- Consultation counts, where reliably recorded.
- Queue and token history.
- Attendance and no-show records.
- Doctor and chamber utilization.
- Cancellation and rejection statistics.
