Historical records should generally be viewed rather than edited through routine history screens.

If correction is necessary, provide an explicitly authorized correction workflow with validation and audit logging.

Do not allow receptionists to modify clinical notes or prescriptions unless that capability is explicitly part of the product's authorized workflow.

